            "author_association": "OWNER",
            "body": "This PR adds:\n- An 8-bit single-cycle CPU design under `fixtures/example_design/`\n- `hero.png` preview image in `README.md`\n- Link to the SVSCH Syntax Book in `README.md`\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n  - Added a complete, explorable 8-bit processor example for viewing SystemVerilog schematics.\n  - Included reusable arithmetic, logic, memory, register, multiplexer, control, immediate-generation, and program-counter components.\n  - Added support for arithmetic, logical, memory, branch, and jump operations in the example processor.\n- **Documentation**\n  - Updated the README with product highlights, a hero preview, syntax resources, live updates, source navigation, and SVG export information.\n- **Tests**\n  - Added visual coverage for all example design modules to help ensure diagrams render consistently.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
